
Practical 3: Conditional_Statements_and_Loops
Objective: Implement if, if-else, elif, while, for, nested loops and break, continue and pass.

Subject: Python for Data Science (BE05000231)

Note: Run the cells from top to bottom. This notebook is written in a simple practical/lab style.

if / if-else / elif

marks = 78
if marks >= 90:
    grade = "A+"
elif marks >= 75:
    grade = "A"
elif marks >= 60:
    grade = "B"
else:
    grade = "C"
print("Grade:", grade)

if marks >= 40:
    print("Pass")
else:
    print("Fail")
     
while loop

i = 1
while i <= 5:
    print(i)
    i += 1
     
for loop

for i in range(1, 6):
    print(i)
     
Nested loop

for i in range(1, 4):
    for j in range(1, 4):
        print(i, j)
     
break, continue and pass

for i in range(1, 8):
    if i == 4:
        break
    print("break:", i)

for i in range(1, 6):
    if i == 3:
        continue
    print("continue:", i)

for i in range(3):
    if i == 1:
        pass
    print("pass:", i)
     
